# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the GL lanes (check-driver with
# SAN=thread on gl/glcore): Mesa's llvmpipe and the LLVM it JITs with
# are not instrumented, so their internal atomics look like plain
# accesses. Libraries only; a race in RetroArch itself still fails.
race:libGLX_mesa.so
race:libGL.so
race:libgallium
race:libLLVM
race:swrast_dri.so
race:libglapi.so
# libdbus, for the screensaver worker (gfx/common/dbus_common.c): it
# closes its private connection while holding the connection lock and
# takes its I/O-path lock the other way round inside a blocking call,
# both on the worker. That connection is the worker's alone, so the
# order cannot meet itself on another thread.
deadlock:libdbus-1.so
